{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementCategory","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementCategory","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinedParticle","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Category.Basic"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.instCategoryConfinedParticle_folio","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.instCategoryConfinedParticle_folio","kind":"instance","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L125-L144","doc":"**Confinement category `Conf`.** The category of confined\nparticles with chain-of-atomic-moves morphisms. The composition\noperator is transparent (list concatenation), so the category\nlaws are proved theorems — no axioms required. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.assoc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.assoc","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L114-L121","doc":"**Associativity** — `h ∘ (g ∘ f) = (h ∘ g) ∘ f`. By induction\non the leftmost (source-side) factor `f`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.id_comp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.id_comp","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L107-L112","doc":"**Left-identity law** — `id ∘ f = f`. By induction on `f`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.comp_id","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.comp_id","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L102-L105","doc":"**Right-identity law** for the public `id` alias. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.comp_id_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.comp_id_def","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L98-L100","doc":"**Right-identity law** — `g ∘ id = g`. By definition (`rfl`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.comp_cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.comp_cons","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L93-L96","doc":"Unfold lemma for `comp` on a `cons` source — true by definition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.comp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.comp","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L84-L91","doc":"**Composition** of confinement morphisms — concatenation of\nchains. Defined by recursion on the second (source-side)\nargument so that `comp_id` is `rfl` and `id_comp`/`assoc`\nfollow by structural induction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.dress","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.dress","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L79-L82","doc":"Smart constructor: a single-step `dress` morphism. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.fold","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.fold","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L74-L77","doc":"Smart constructor: a single-step `fold` morphism. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.unfold","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.unfold","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L69-L72","doc":"Smart constructor: a single-step `unfold` morphism. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.id","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.id","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L66-L67","doc":"Identity morphism on `P` — alias for `nil`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.cons","kind":"ctor","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L60-L62","doc":"Prepend an atomic move to an existing chain. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism.nil","kind":"ctor","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L58-L59","doc":"Empty chain — identity morphism on `P`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ConfMorphism","kind":"inductive","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L52-L62","doc":"**Confinement morphism.** A chain of atomic moves\n`P = X₀ → X₁ → ⋯ → X_n = Q`. The empty chain is the identity;\ncomposition is list concatenation (defined transparently below\nso the category laws are proved, not axiomatised). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AtomicConfMove.dress","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AtomicConfMove.dress","kind":"ctor","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L48-L50","doc":"Dress `P_bare` with a named shell, producing `P_dressed`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AtomicConfMove.fold","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AtomicConfMove.fold","kind":"ctor","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L44-L47","doc":"Fold `P` to a coarser representation `P'`\n(`P'.level = P.level + 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AtomicConfMove.unfold","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AtomicConfMove.unfold","kind":"ctor","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L40-L43","doc":"Unfold `P` to a finer representation `P'`\n(`P.level = P'.level + 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AtomicConfMove","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AtomicConfMove","kind":"inductive","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ConfinementCategory.lean#L35-L50","doc":"**Atomic confinement move.** A single generator of the\nconfinement category — unfolding, folding, or dressing. The\nfull morphism `P → Q` is a list (chain) of these. ","signatureChunk":0}]}